                                "sense_id": "93cab8af-8b0e-3d8f-8cb8-798f03868740",
                                "text": "And while Harvey was taking in knowledge of new things at each pore and hard health with every gulp of the good air, the We're Here went her ways and did her business on the Bank, and the silvery-gray kenches of well-pressed fish mounted higher and higher in the hold."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3838dd8-d3f7-4568-abb9-414bf46e2f73",
                                "sense_id": "93cab8af-8b0e-3d8f-8cb8-798f03868740",
                                "text": "In the former process, the fish are thoroughly salted and placed in regular piles on top of each other, called kenches."
